OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'true lady'
OL,4,Ahairdresser killed in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired hairdresser who died after a
OL,7,Fcar crash has been described as a "true
OL,8,Flady" in a tribute from her family.
OL,10,FGillian Dixon, 76, was a passenger in a
OL,11,FFiat Punto involved in a crash with a
OL,12,Fdark-coloured Toyota Land Cruiser on
OL,13,Fthe A3057 near Goodworth Clatford,
OL,14,FHampshire, shortly after 17:45 BST on
OL,15,F29 August.
OL,17,FHer family, who said she was known as
OL,18,FGilly and lived in Houghton, described
OL,19,Fher as "the kindest, most caring and
OL,20,Fgentle person" who "put everyone before
OL,21,Fherself and worried about everyone,
OL,22,Feven those she barely knew".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
