OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Fiat driver, an 80-year-old man,
OL,7,Fwas taken to hospital with
OL,8,Flife-threatening injuries. Hampshire
OL,9,FPolice said he remained in a stable
OL,10,Fcondition.
